### ─── Product catalog endpoints ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### Uses the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
### Product endpoints require an ADMIN or PHARMACIST bearer token.
###
### Category values:
###   OTC                  → Over-the-counter (no prescription needed)
###   PRESCRIPTION_ONLY    → Requires a prescription
###   PSYCHOTROPIC         → Controlled psychoactive substance
###   NARCOTIC             → Controlled narcotic substance
###   NON_PHARMACEUTICAL   → Cosmetics, supplements, hygiene items, etc.
###
### Quick start:
###   1. Start the API:  npm start
###   2. Send the "LOGIN as pharmacist" request below.
###   3. Use "Send Request" on any of the product endpoints.

@host = http://localhost
@port = 3000
@base = {{host}}:{{port}}/api


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LOGIN as pharmacist (required before calling product endpoints)
### Expect: 200 + accessToken
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name loginPharmacist
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "pharmacist@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ── Store token for later requests ────────────────────────────────────────

@accessToken = {{loginPharmacist.response.body.accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE PRODUCT — pharmacist creates an OTC product (AC1)
### Expect: 201 + created product
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name createProduct
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "dciName": "Paracetamol",
  "commercialName": "Tylenol REST",
  "laboratory": "PharmaCo",
  "form": "Tableta",
  "concentration": "500mg",
  "barcode": "1234567890123",
  "category": "OTC",
  "salePrice": 12.50,
  "costPrice": 8.00,
  "minStock": 10
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE PRODUCT — prescription-only product
### Expect: 201 + created product with category PRESCRIPTION_ONLY
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name createPrescriptionProduct
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "dciName": "Amoxicilina",
  "commercialName": "Amoxil REST",
  "laboratory": "GSK",
  "form": "Cápsula",
  "concentration": "500mg",
  "barcode": "1234567890124",
  "category": "PRESCRIPTION_ONLY",
  "salePrice": 35.00,
  "costPrice": 22.00,
  "minStock": 50
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE PRODUCT — controlled substance (PSYCHOTROPIC)
### Expect: 201; downstream SalesModule will use isControlled=true
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "dciName": "Diazepam",
  "commercialName": "Valium REST",
  "laboratory": "Roche",
  "form": "Tableta",
  "concentration": "10mg",
  "barcode": "1234567890125",
  "category": "PSYCHOTROPIC",
  "salePrice": 45.00,
  "costPrice": 30.00,
  "minStock": 5
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CREATE PRODUCT — duplicate barcode returns 409 DUPLICATE_BARCODE
### Expect: 409 with code "DUPLICATE_BARCODE" and field "barcode"
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "dciName": "Duplicate",
  "commercialName": "Duplicate Barcode",
  "barcode": "1234567890123",
  "category": "OTC",
  "salePrice": 1.00,
  "costPrice": 0.50,
  "minStock": 0
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LIST PRODUCTS — paginated, default page=1, pageSize=20
### Query params: page, pageSize (max 100), category, active, q
### Expect: 200 + { data, total, page, pageSize, totalPages }
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LIST PRODUCTS — filtered by category and search term
### Expect: 200 + filtered paginated list
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/products?page=1&pageSize=10&category=OTC&active=true&q=Tylenol
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### SEARCH PRODUCTS — autocomplete by name or barcode
### Expect: 200 + array of matching products
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/products/search?q=Tylenol
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### GET PRODUCT BY ID
### Replace :id with a real product id, or use the chained variable below.
### Expect: 200 + product
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/products/f56b2f81-dfad-4f62-a51e-638a3b8b97c1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### UPDATE PRODUCT — partial update
### Expect: 200 + updated product
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/products/f56b2f81-dfad-4f62-a51e-638a3b8b97c1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "commercialName": "Tylenol REST Updated",
  "salePrice": 13.00,
  "minStock": 20
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### UPDATE PRODUCT — duplicate barcode on update returns 409
### Expect: 409 DUPLICATE_BARCODE
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/products/f56b2f81-dfad-4f62-a51e-638a3b8b97c1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "barcode": "1234567890124"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### DEACTIVATE PRODUCT — soft-delete / set active=false
### Expect: 200 + deactivated product
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/products/f56b2f81-dfad-4f62-a51e-638a3b8b97c1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ACTIVATE PRODUCT — restore a deactivated product
### Expect: 200 + restored product
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PATCH {{base}}/products/f56b2f81-dfad-4f62-a51e-638a3b8b97c1/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### BULK IMPORT — inline CSV with valid and invalid rows
### Expect: 200 + { inserted, failed: [{ row, barcode, errors: [...] }] }
### The file must be sent as multipart/form-data with field name "file".
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/products/bulk-import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxk
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

dciName,commercialName,barcode,category,salePrice,costPrice,minStock
Ibuprofeno,Ibuprom Bulk,9876543210123,OTC,18.00,11.00,80
Loratadina,Clarityne Bulk,9876543210124,OTC,20.00,12.00,60
Invalid Row,,BAD-BARCODE,OTC,5.00,3.00,20

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxk--


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### BULK IMPORT — load the sample CSV file from open-api/documents
### Expect: 200 + { inserted, failed: [...] }
### Sample file contains 6 valid rows and 3 invalid rows.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/products/bulk-import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxk
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxk
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products-sample-import.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../documents/products-sample-import.csv

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxk--


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FORBIDDEN — cashier tries to create a product
### First login as a cashier, then use that token here.
### Expect: 403 Forbidden
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name loginCashier
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cashier@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCashier.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "dciName": "Unauthorized",
  "commercialName": "Unauthorized Product",
  "barcode": "9999999999999",
  "category": "OTC",
  "salePrice": 1.00,
  "costPrice": 0.50,
  "minStock": 0
}
